/**
 * Elemental contracts — the two directions a nation's identity reaches the
 * mission board.
 *
 *  SIGNATURE  contracts only your own element unlocks. This is what makes an
 *             Ember run read differently from a Tide one at the board, not just
 *             in the modifiers.
 *  DIPLOMATIC contracts generated by your standing with a specific village.
 *             Relations were previously something you READ; this is where they
 *             finally produce something you DO.
 *
 * Shaped exactly like the templates in constants.js / missionGen.js — `n, rk,
 * ryo, rep, dur, risk, mp, sq, spec` — so the existing board machinery, the
 * spec modifiers and the terrain layer all read them with no special case.
 *
 * Pure data + pure selectors. No G access. Unit-tested.
 */

